# Effect

This repository uses the Effect TypeScript library (`effect`, `@effect/platform-node`).

## Learning more about Effect

Before writing any Effect code, first read `node_modules/effect/AGENTS.md`
**completely**, and follow the links in that file when required.

If you need to learn more about particular Effect APIs and concepts that the
guide doesn't cover, search the source code in `node_modules/effect/src`.

Use only this vendored documentation and source. Ignore unrelated copies of
Effect or external documentation — they may be outdated or incorrect.

## Installing / upgrading

Use pnpm (see `packageManager` in `package.json`):

```bash
pnpm add effect@beta
```

In a monorepo, install it as a root dev dependency so `node_modules/effect/src`
stays reachable:

```bash
pnpm add -D effect@beta
```
